<title>USA: Nissan January US car sales rise.</title>
<headline>Nissan January US car sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nissan Motor Co Ltd</p>
<p>			Jan 1-31, 1997     Jan 1-31, 1996 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    24,022	    21,963	     +9.4</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  10,614	    11,842	    -10.4</p>
<p> Import Car		14,314	    12,056	    +18.7</p>
<p> Import Truck	     6,003	     3,791	    +58.3</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 26 in latest month vs 26 in year-ago period.</p>
</text>
